# === Design-system scratch (AI-generated mockup specs, not consumer-facing) ===
# The actual living design system lives inside packages/terminal/ — Tailwind v4
# CSS variables, shadcn/ui components, the three cinematic themes, and Glass
# Adaptive utilities. The standalone /design-system/ folder is a scratchpad
# for AI-generated design-rule outputs and should not ship with the public repo.
/design-system/

# === Agent context is TRACKED (public repo, open for contributions) ===
# CLAUDE.md / AGENTS.md / PLAN.md (and per-package agent docs, if added) SHIP
# with the repo so every contributor and every agent — any OS, any model —
# works from the same source of truth. They are NOT machine-local.
# Only the per-machine GENERATED copies under .local/agent-context/ stay
# ignored (covered by the .local/ rule above); the canonical files are tracked.

# === Planning files (session-specific) ===
task_plan.md
findings.md
progress.md

